{"type":"message","id":"253be942","parentId":"2fb8cec1","timestamp":"2026-03-27T02:05:30.658Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"While the feedback check is running, let me also activate xixi to scan for new PRs/issues so we have a continuous pipeline.","thinkingSignature":"35dcfe95ff89a8987818ea9fbc30ad8b09d4b7c2632d651ac4adbba762aa1b73"},{"type":"text","text":"\n反馈检查已在后台运行。同时派 xixi 扫描新 PR/issue，保持 pipeline 持续运转：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_zo5pnv8rxvo2_1","name":"sessions_send","arguments":{"sessionKey":"agent:xixi:feishu:xixi:direct:ou_7e95c6c474ffd4086e3a05454dd29c24","message":"任务：继续扫描 openclaw/openclaw repo 的新 open PR 和 issue\n\n目标：找到 1-2 个可以贡献高质量 review 或 issue 的新目标\n\n上下文：\n- 我们已有 6 个 open 项：#54952、#54964（issue）、#55008、#55013（PR）、#55153、#55137（已 review）\n- 所有已发内容均无 maintainer 新反馈\n- 项目背景：帮助范总冲 OpenClaw contributors 前 20\n- repo: openclaw/openclaw\n\n交付：\n1. 列出最近 3 天内新开的 PR（按更新时间排序，过滤已 merge）\n2. 列出最近 3 天内新开的 issue（按更新时间排序，过滤已 close）\n3. 每个 PR/issue 给出：一句话描述 + 是否值得 review/issue 的判断（值得/不值得/不确定）\n4. 最值得注意的 1-2 个给出详细理由\n\n优先级判断标准：\n- PR：fix 逻辑是否重要、是否和我们的贡献方向相关、review 是否能提供建设性意见\n- issue：是否是 docs gap、diagnostics gap、usability gap，而非已确认的 complex bug\n\n完成后直接回 main（我）。"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":4439,"output":374,"cacheRead":22191,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":27004,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774577116991}}
