ishu): address EronFan review — handle schema 1.0 elements in j…\",\"oid\":\"e7ea88f752b75513c0f1abe53922724b955b7878\"}],\"decision\":null}"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":567,"aggregated":"{\"commits\":[{\"authoredDate\":\"2026-03-27T01:49:15Z\",\"authors\":[{\"email\":\"guoqunabc@pku.edu.cn\",\"id\":\"MDQ6VXNlcjk1MzIwMjA=\",\"login\":\"guoqunabc\",\"name\":\"guoqunabc\"}],\"committedDate\":\"2026-03-27T02:01:43Z\",\"messageBody\":\"…ntent param\\n\\n- Add card_msg_content_type=raw_card_content param to message.get and message.list\\n  API calls so the IM API returns the full json_card structure instead of fallback\\n  screenshot content for CardKit streaming cards.\\n\\n- Extend parseInteractiveCardContent to extract text from the json_card format:\\n  reads config.summary.content and recursively extracts plain_text/markdown nodes\\n  from body.elements. Falls through to existing element parsing on failure.\\n\\n- Add extractJsonCardTexts helper for recursive text extraction from nested\\n  CardKit element structures (column_set, nested elements, etc.).\\n\\n- Add tests for json_card parsing, param passing, and fallback behavior.\",\"messageHeadline\":\"fix(feishu): read full CardKit streaming card content via raw_card_co…\",\"oid\":\"97c85df92dfadace1820ba784a6afdb519ad3e08\"},{\"authoredDate\":\"2026-03-27T02:00:26Z\",\"authors\":[{\"email\":\"guoqunabc@pku.edu.cn\",\"id\":\"MDQ6VXNlcjk1MzIwMjA=\",\"login\":\"guoqunabc\",\"name\":\"guoqunabc\"}],\"committedDate\":\"2026-03-27T02:01:43Z\",\"messageBody\":\"…s type\",\"messageHeadline\":\"fix(feishu): address review feedback — remove any cast and unused row…\",\"oid\":\"cf582f3a5edd32500e77d49aa8cb58e4d96abbc6\"},{\"authoredDate\":\"2026-03-27T02:18:53Z\",\"authors\":[{\"email\":\"guoqunabc@pku.edu.cn\",\"id\":\"MDQ6VXNlcjk1MzIwMjA=\",\"login\":\"guoqunabc\",\"name\":\"guoqunabc\"}],\"committedDate\":\"2026-03-27T02:18:53Z\",\"messageBody\":\"…son_card\",\"messageHeadline\":\"fix(feis