n            {\n              \"type\": \"text\",\n              \"text\": \"已更新，新的 fallback 配置：\\n\\n| 优先级 | 模型 |\\n|--------|------|\\n| primary | `minimax/MiniMax-M2.7` |\\n| fallback 1 | `arkcode/glm-4.7` ✅ |\\n| fallback 2 | `doubao-2/doubao-seed-2.0-code` ✅ |\\n| ~~fallback 3~~ | ~~已移除~~ |\\n\\n备份在 `~/.openclaw/openclaw.json.bak`，需要回滚可以说。\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"api\": \"anthropic-messages\",\n          \"provider\": \"minimax\",\n          \"model\": \"MiniMax-M2.7\",\n          \"stopReason\": \"stop\",\n          \"timestamp\": 1774575375977\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"key\": \"agent:xixi:feishu:xixi:direct:ou_7e95c6c474ffd4086e3a05454dd29c24\",\n      \"kind\": \"other\",\n      \"channel\": \"webchat\",\n      \"displayName\": \"webchat:g-agent-xixi-feishu-xixi-direct-ou_7e95c6c474ffd4086e3a05454dd29c24\",\n      \"deliveryContext\": {\n        \"channel\": \"webchat\"\n      },\n      \"updatedAt\": 1774577230883,\n      \"sessionId\": \"187d71cf-e471-4f44-a050-29007b4aaffb\",\n      \"model\": \"MiniMax-M2.7\",\n      \"contextTokens\": 200000,\n      \"totalTokens\": 108606,\n      \"abortedLastRun\": false,\n      \"lastChannel\": \"webchat\",\n      \"transcriptPath\": \"/root/.openclaw/agents/xixi/sessions/187d71cf-e471-4f44-a050-29007b4aaffb.jsonl\",\n      \"messages\": [\n        {\n          \"role\": \"assistant\",\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"thinking\",\n              \"thinking\": \"There are tons of new PRs and issues. Now I need to filter the most relevant ones to our contribution focus areas: diagnostics, routing, sessions, bindings, docs, multi-agent, gateway. Let me look at the most relevant ones and read the details.\\n\\nKey items that stand out as potentially relevant:\\n- #55458 Status: surface memory probe errors instead of hiding them - this is a DIAGNOSTICS issue, directly related to what we found\\n- #55469 fix(agents): anchor subagent announce to requester session key (#55437) - related to sessions/subagents\\n- #55474 [Bug]: Discord session.resetTriggers matches !new, but sessionId does not rotate - session management bug\\n\\n\\n- #55479 [Bug] External skills are ready but not injected into multi-agent specialist runtime in v2026.3.24 - skills/agents issue\\n- #55472 Bug: Gateway config reload/failover corrupts agents.defaults.model - gateway bug\\n- #55473 Gateway: degrade startup secret failures - gateway startup\\n- #55427 test(skills): add precedence regression tests for workspace > managed > bundled - skills precedence\\n- #55419 docs(agent-loop): correct default timeoutSeconds from 600s to 172800s (48h) - this is a docs fix, we could verify\\n- #55395 fix: centralize plugin command auth requirements - plugin system\\n- #55442 fix: allow memory_search and memory_get in sub-agent sessions - related to our memory_search focus\\n\\nI'm seeing several gateway and session-related issues that align with our diagnostic work, plus a few skill and plugin system fixes that could be good verification targets.\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"toolCall\",\n              \"id\": \"call_function_i9drqeb9rero_1\",\n              \"name\": \"exec\",\n              \"arguments\": {\n                \"command\": \"gh api repos/openclaw/openclaw/issues/55458 --jq '{title,body,labels,comments}' 2>/dev/null && echo '---' && gh api repos/openclaw/openclaw/issues/55479 --jq '{title,body,labels,comments}' 2>/dev/null && echo '---' && gh api repos/openclaw/openclaw/issues/55472 --jq '{title,body,labels,comments}' 2>/dev/null\",\n                \"workdir\": \"/root/.openclaw/workspaces/workspace-xixi\",\n                \"yieldMs\": 15000,\n                \"timeout\": 25\n              }\n            }\n          ],\n          \"api\": \"anthropic-messages\",\n          \"provider\": \"minimax\",\n          \"model\": \"MiniMax-M2.7\",\n          \"stopReason\": \"toolUse\",\n          \"timestamp\": 1774577177639\n        },\n        {\n          \"role\": \"assistant\",\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"thinking\",\n              \"thinking\": \"Now I have enough info. Let me identify the most notable ones:\\n\\n1. **#55479 [Bug] External skills are ready but not injected into multi-agent specialist runtime in v2026.3.24** - This is a REAL bug with clear repro steps, recent (created today), size XS, has good evidence. This is worth reviewing/confirming.\\n\\n2. **#55458 Status: surface memory probe errors instead of hiding them** - This is a DIAGNOSTICS gap, directly aligns with our ongoing diagnostics theme. It's a size XL PR (large). The PR description is clear but the PR author notes \\\"No functional tests added\\\" which is a potential review comment point.\\n   \\n3. **#55472 Bug: Gateway config reload/failover corrupts agents.defaults.model** - Another genuine bug with solid reproduction steps from today, though the config writer corruption aspect feels like it might overlap with what we're already tracking.\\n\\n4. **#55419 docs(agent-loop): correct default timeoutSeconds from 600s to 172800s** - This is a straightforward docs PR just correcting a timeout value, but since the maintainer hasn't reviewed it yet, I could potentially verify the correction and add a confirming comment.\\n\\nThe most actionable items are the external skills injection bug where I can confirm the reproduction, the memory probe diagnostics PR where I can flag the missing test coverage, and the gateway config issue—though that's probably already on someone's radar given how recent it is.\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"text\",\n              \"text\": \" 扫描完毕。结论如下：\\n\\n---\\n\\n**3天内新 open PR/issue（过滤后）：约 120+ 条，太多了不逐列。**\\n\\n---\\n\\n**最值得注意的 2 个：**\\n\\n---\\n\\n**#55479 — [Bug] External skills ready but not injected into multi-agent specialist runtime**  \\n一句话：外部技能在 `skills list` 里显示 ready，但 specialist agent 运行时收不到，只有 bundled skills。  \\n**值得 review。** 有完整 repro steps + JSON 输出证据，size XS，今天刚开，maintainer 还未处理。  \\n可以做的动作：确认 repro 是否可复现，或问一句\\\"这个是否和 `skills list` 显示 ready 的路径与 specialist runtime 注入路径分离有关\\\"。\\n\\n---\\n\\n**#55458 — Status: surface memory probe errors instead of hiding them**  \\n一句话：memory probe 失败时 `status` 命令吞掉错误，用户看到的是正常输出但实际 probe 已挂。  \\n**值得 confirm + note test coverage。** 这是典型的 diagnostics gap，和我们之前挖的 `matchedBy` 不暴露是同一类问题。  \\nPR 本身方向对，但作者自述\\\"No functional tests added\\\"，review 时可以提一句。\\n\\n---\\n\\n**其余判断：**\\n\\n- **不值得现在追**（非我们的贡献方向，或已被 maintainer 标注 size XL/L 或已有 maintainer 标签）\\n- #55472 gateway config 腐败那个 bug 描述很完整，但 config writer/validator 不对齐属于较深实现问题，review 风险高\\n- #55419 docs timeout 修正是真 docs fix，但太小，maintainer 还没 review 前可以顺手 confirm\\n- #55427 skills precedence regression tests — 维护者自己提的 test，覆盖的是 workspace/managed/bundled 优先级，方向对，可以直接 approve\\n\\n---\\n\\n**推荐动作顺序：**\\n1. 先对 #55479 留一条确认 comment（附上我们多 agent 环境的验证情况）\\n2. 对 #55458 提 test coverage 建议\\n3. 其余暂不动\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"api\": \"anthropic-messages\",\n          \"provider\": \"minimax\",\n          \"model\": \"MiniMax-M2.7\",\n          \"stopReason\": \"stop\",\n          \"timestamp\": 1774577198753\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}"}],"details":{"count":5,"sessions":[{"key":"agent:main:cron:57a448ff-1805-4a54-a6cd-3fcdbb5fb8f3","kind":"other","channel":"unknown","label":"Cron: OpenClaw 反馈检查","displayName":"Cron: OpenClaw 反馈检查","updatedAt":1774609403204,"sessionId":"e8153ab7-5d1e-4b82-a5c2-0529fa40ccb3","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","contextTokens":200000,"totalTokens":24743,"systemSent":true,"transcriptPath":"/root/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/e8153ab7-5d1e-4b82-a5c2-0529fa40ccb3.jsonl","messages":[]},{"key":"agent:main:feishu:group:oc_f68e4447ecaeb604046c3d8ef84681f3","kind":"group","channel":"feishu","displayName":"feishu:g-oc_f68e4447ecaeb604046c3d8ef84681f3","deliveryContext":{"channel":"feishu","to":"chat:oc_f68e4447ecaeb604046c3d8ef84681f3","acco