view 是否能提供建设性意见\\n- issue：是否是 docs gap、diagnostics gap、usability gap，而非已确认的 complex bug\\n\\n完成后直接回 main（我）。\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"timestamp\": 1774577150905,\n      \"provenance\": {\n        \"kind\": \"inter_session\",\n        \"sourceSessionKey\": \"agent:main:feishu:group:oc_f68e4447ecaeb604046c3d8ef84681f3\",\n        \"sourceChannel\": \"feishu\",\n        \"sourceTool\": \"sessions_send\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"role\": \"assistant\",\n      \"content\": [\n        {\n          \"type\": \"thinking\",\n          \"thinking\": \"Main is asking me to scan the openclaw/openclaw repo for recently opened PRs and issues (last 3 days). Let me use gh api to fetch them.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"toolCall\",\n          \"id\": \"call_function_ixmvnsvid30m_1\",\n          \"name\": \"exec\",\n          \"arguments\": {\n            \"command\": \"gh api repos/openclaw/openclaw/pulls --paginate --jq '.[] | select(.updated_at >= \\\"2026-03-24\\\") | {number,title,state,updated_at,created_at,additions,deletions,changed_files,user:{login}}' 2>/dev/null | head -120\",\n            \"workdir\": \"/root/.openclaw/workspaces/workspace-xixi\",\n            \"yieldMs\": 15000,\n            \"timeout\": 30\n          }\n        }\n      ],\n      \"api\": \"anthropic-messages\",\n      \"provider\": \"minimax\",\n      \"model\": \"MiniMax-M2.7\",\n      \"stopReason\": \"toolUse\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1774577150912\n    },\n    {\n      \"role\": \"assistant\",\n      \"content\": [\n        {\n          \"type\": \"thinking\",\n          \"thinking\": \"There are a LOT of open PRs. Now let me get the issues too.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"toolCall\",\n          \"id\": \"call_function_pulj8a1rgi4r_1\",\n          \"name\": \"exec\",\n          \"arguments\": {\n            \"command\": \"gh api repos/openclaw/openclaw/issues --paginate --jq '.[] | select(.updated_at >= \\\"2026-03-24\\\" and .state == \\\"open\\\