teway and session-related issues that align with our diagnostic work, plus a few skill and plugin system fixes that could be good verification targets.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"toolCall\",\n          \"id\": \"call_function_i9drqeb9rero_1\",\n          \"name\": \"exec\",\n          \"arguments\": {\n            \"command\": \"gh api repos/openclaw/openclaw/issues/55458 --jq '{title,body,labels,comments}' 2>/dev/null && echo '---' && gh api repos/openclaw/openclaw/issues/55479 --jq '{title,body,labels,comments}' 2>/dev/null && echo '---' && gh api repos/openclaw/openclaw/issues/55472 --jq '{title,body,labels,comments}' 2>/dev/null\",\n            \"workdir\": \"/root/.openclaw/workspaces/workspace-xixi\",\n            \"yieldMs\": 15000,\n            \"timeout\": 25\n          }\n        }\n      ],\n      \"api\": \"anthropic-messages\",\n      \"provider\": \"minimax\",\n      \"model\": \"MiniMax-M2.7\",\n      \"stopReason\": \"toolUse\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1774577177639\n    },\n    {\n      \"role\": \"assistant\",\n      \"content\": [\n        {\n          \"type\": \"thinking\",\n          \"thinking\": \"Now I have enough info. Let me identify the most notable ones:\\n\\n1. **#55479 [Bug] External skills are ready but not injected into multi-agent specialist runtime in v2026.3.24** - This is a REAL bug with clear repro steps, recent (created today), size XS, has good evidence. This is worth reviewing/confirming.\\n\\n2. **#55458 Status: surface memory probe errors instead of hiding them** - This is a DIAGNOSTICS gap, directly aligns with our ongoing diagnostics theme. It's a size XL PR (large). The PR description is clear but the PR author notes \\\"No functional tests added\\\" which is a potential review comment point.\\n   \\n3. **#55472 Bug: Gateway config reload/failover corrupts agents.defaults.model** - Another genuine bug with solid reproduction steps from today, though the config writer corruption aspect feels like it might overlap with what we're already tracking.\\n\\n4. **#55419 docs(agent-loop): correct default timeoutSeconds from 600s to 172800s** - This is a straightforward docs PR just correcting a timeout value, but since the maintainer hasn't reviewed it yet, I could potentially verify the correction and add a confirming comment.\\n\\nThe most actionable items are the external skills injection bug where I can confirm the reproduction, the memory probe diagnostics PR where I can flag the missing test coverage, and the gateway config issue—though that's probably already on someone's radar given how recent it is.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"text\",\n          \"text\": \" 扫描完毕。结论如下：\\n\\n---\\n\\n**3天内新 open PR/issue（过滤后）：约 120+ 条，太多了不逐列。**\\n\\n---\\n\\n**最值得注意的 2 个：**\\n\\n---\\n\\n**#55479 — [Bug] External skills ready but not injected into multi-agent specialist runtime**  \\n一句话：外部技能在 `skills list` 里显示 ready，但 specialist agent 运行时收不到，只有 bundled skills。  \\n**值得 review。** 有完整 repro steps + JSON 输出证据，size XS，今天刚开，maintainer 还未处理。  \\n可以做的动作：确认 repro 是否可复现，或问一句\\\"这个是否和 `skills list` 显示 ready 的路径与 specialist runtime 注入路径分离有关\\\"。\\n\\n---\\n\\n**#55458 — Status: surface memory probe errors instead of hiding them**  \\n一句话：memory probe 失败时 `status` 命令吞掉错误，用户看到的是正常输出但实际 probe 已挂。  \\n**值得 confirm + note test coverage。** 这是典型的 diagnostics gap，和我们之前挖的 `matchedBy` 不暴露是同一类问题。  \\nPR 本身方向对，但作者自述\\\"No functional tests added\\\"，review 时可以提一句。\\n\\n---\\n\\n**其余判断：**\\n\\n- **不值得现在追**（非我们的贡献方向，或已被 maintainer 标注 size XL/L 或已有 maintainer 标签）\\n- #55472 gateway config 腐败那个 bug 描述很完整，但 config writer/validator 不对齐属于较深实现问题，review 风险高\\n- #55419 docs timeout 修正是真 docs fix，但太小，maintainer 还没 review 前可以顺手 confirm\\n- #55427 skills precedence regression tests — 维护者自己提的 test，覆盖的是 workspace/managed/bundled 优先级，方向对，可以直接 approve\\n\\n---\\n\\n**推荐动作顺序：**\\n1. 先对 #55479 留一条确认 comment（附上我们多 agent 环境的验证情况）\\n2. 对 #55458 提 test coverage 建议\\n3. 其余暂不动\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \