{"type":"message","id":"2d21a158","parentId":"da759214","timestamp":"2026-03-27T11:11:52.243Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to search the internet and community for potential directions we can test/contribute. This is a broader research task - looking at OpenClaw community discussions, Discord, GitHub issues, etc. to find untested areas or reproduction opportunities.\n\nLet me spawn a research task - I should look at:\n1. OpenClaw Discord\n2. GitHub issues/PRs discussions\n3. Any community forums or discussions\n4. Search the web for OpenClaw related content\n\nThis is a big research task. Let me think about what's the best approach:\n1. Web search for OpenClaw discussions\n2. Check Discord/community channels\n3. Look for common complaints or untested areas\n\nActually, xixi is the research agent. \n\nI'll coordinate with xixi to conduct this broad research across the OpenClaw ecosystem - checking Discord, GitHub discussions, and community forums to identify untested areas or common issues we could contribute to.","thinkingSignature":"8fc086c82efb7960fd0497833ed3f815f216c9a65560344017547481b29eb0e9"},{"type":"text","text":"好，交给 xixi 做深度调研 👇\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_d4eb7xqinepz_1","name":"sessions_send","arguments":{"sessionKey":"agent:xixi:feishu:xixi:direct:ou_7e95c6c474ffd4086e3a05454dd29c24","message":"任务：社区调研 + 互联网搜索，挖掘 OpenClaw 可测试/可贡献的方向\n\n目标：找到 3-5 个我们还没覆盖的、高价值的 testing/reproduction 机会\n\n调研范围：\n1. **GitHub issues/PRs** — 找 recent 未确认的 bug report、unclear 的设计讨论，特别是\"有人报告但没人复现\"的\n2. **Discord OpenClaw 社区** — 找常见问题、安装问题、配置踩坑（网页搜索）\n3. **搜索引擎** — 搜 \"OpenClaw bug\", \"OpenClaw not working\", \"OpenClaw setup issue\" 等，找真实用户痛点\n4. ** clawhub.com / 社区讨论** — 找 skills 相关的坑或未覆盖场景\n\n判断标准：\n- 能本地复现 → 推荐测试 + potential issue\n- 能本地验证某个未确认假设 → 推荐验证\n- 是 docs gap 或 usability gap → 推荐 issue 或 PR\n- 是我们已有项的延伸 → 标注\"已覆盖\"\n\n交付：\n1. 每条发现：一句话描述 + 来源 + 可测试性判断（高/中/低）\n2. 最值得测试的 1-2 个给出详细 repro 步骤建议