{"type":"message","id":"bfb459b4","parentId":"5041ff83","timestamp":"2026-03-27T11:35:56.818Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now let me create a new every-4h cron for community research.","thinkingSignature":"a21f656a7e2d8f25dde7e8a9123fb60165210e7961f2223df3eef9ce676d23e2"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_rteu9gan6m5a_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"openclaw cron create \\\n  --name \"OpenClaw 社区机会扫描\" \\\n  --every \"4h\" \\\n  --agent \"isolated\" \\\n  --model \"arkcode/deepseek-v3.2\" \\\n  --no-deliver \\\n  --session \"isolated\" \\\n  --message \"任务：扫描 OpenClaw 社区新机会（定时主动执行）\n\n你是 OpenClaw 贡献项目的主动侦查员。每 4 小时自动执行，不需要任何人催促。\n\n步骤：\n1. gh api 查最近 6h 内更新的 open GitHub issues 和 PRs（过滤已 merge/已 close）\n2. 重点找：regression、未确认 bug、usability gap、docs gap\n3. 读每个候选详情，判断是否值得 action\n4. 在 memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md 的当前优先级表格中确认未重复\n\n已覆盖项（勿重复）：\n#54952 #54964 #55008 #55013 #55153 #55137 #55466 #55458 #55479\n\n判断标准：\n- 能本地复现 + 严重度高 → 直接测试并更新文件\n- docs gap / usability gap → 更新文件并考虑发 issue/PR\n- 已是热门/有人处理中 → 跳过\n\n交付：\n- 有值得 action 的新发现 → 更新 memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md\n- 无新发现 → 回复 NO_REPLY\n\n禁止向任何聊天渠道发消息、禁止 git commit。\n\nCurrent time: \\$(date '+\\%Y-\\%m-\\%d \\%H:\\%M \\%Z')\" 2>&1","timeout":15}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":37073,"output":384,"cacheRead":22191,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":59648,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774611346754}}
